{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想掌握日常開支，又不想連結銀行帳戶或把財務資料交給第三方？《Budget》是一款主打極簡、極速的離線記帳工具，適合早已厭倦繁複理財程式的使用者，每筆收支只需點擊一下即可記錄。這款應用程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>極速記帳兼顧離線私隱</h2>\n<p>每筆開支或收入記錄只需 5 秒，操作僅為點擊一下，完成後即可關閉程式。你可為租金、雜貨、燃油與外出用餐設定每月預算上限，並以簡潔的月度總覽查看收支與剩餘金額。工具完全離線運作，資料只留本機並經個人 iCloud 同步，另支援分帳、儲蓄目標、收據拍照與 CSV 或 PDF 匯出。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-491-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-492-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-493-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-494-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-495-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-496-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Budget: Track, Save &amp; Prosper</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T07:58:01.410466+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}